      "content": "While the description is very specific, attributing it to quantum interaction with lab particles is speculative without rigorous testing. The sensory disturbances you detail suggest a potential change in how your brain is processing visual information. However, many neurological conditions can cause pareidolia or heightened sensory awareness that mimics precognition. It is crucial that a physician evaluates these correlations to rule out conditions before considering more exotic causes.",
